            "image_ratio": "adapt",
            "image_overlay_opacity": 0,
            "sub_heading": "",
            "subheading_divider": false,
            "heading": "The New Zealand Fine Wine Story",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "description": "<p>New Zealand’s wine scene is young - but that’s exactly what makes it exciting. This experience celebrates the modern pioneers: the winemakers breaking new ground, the regions rewriting the rulebook, and the bottles that have quietly earned global respect. Taste the energy, the innovation, and the craftsmanship that define fine wine - Kiwi style.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "vertical_content_padding": 40,
            "vertical_content_padding_mobile": 40,
            "alignment": "center",
            "width": "50%",
            "animations": "inherit"
          }
        },
        "image_card_4Pn8Pj": {
          "type": "image_card",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "layout7",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC06686_de11f982-06b0-455d-a40e-4130fc8b759a.jpg",
            "mobile_image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC06686_de11f982-06b0-455d-a40e-4130fc8b759a.jpg",
            "image_ratio": "adapt",
            "image_overlay_opacity": 0,
            "sub_heading": "",
            "subheading_divider": false,
            "heading": "New Zealand Wine - But Not As You Know It",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "description": "<p>Sauvignon Blanc put New Zealand on the map - and with good reason. But there’s so much more to discover. In this tasting event, we’ll explore the country’s lesser-known styles and regions, from bright, mineral whites to characterful reds that reflect the full diversity of this remarkable wine-growing landscape.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "vertical_content_padding": 40,
            "vertical_content_padding_mobile": 40,
            "alignment": "center",
            "width": "50%",
            "animations": "inherit"
          }
        },
        "image_card_pfNHtT": {
          "type": "image_card",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "layout7",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC01613.jpg",
            "mobile_image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC01613.jpg",
            "image_ratio": "adapt",
            "image_overlay_opacity": 0,
            "sub_heading": "",
            "subheading_divider": false,
            "heading": "New Zealand Vs Rest Of The World",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "description": "<p>How do New Zealand wines stack up globally? In this side-by-side tasting, we’ll explore what makes them shine - from cool-climate elegance to bold, distinctive character. A relaxed, eye-opening comparison that shows just how confidently New Zealand holds its own among the great wine regions of the world.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "vertical_content_padding": 40,
            "vertical_content_padding_mobile": 40,
