    "testimonials_A4tPRC": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_BJkFq3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>“If you’re looking for an experience that’s inspiring, unexpected, and genuinely fun, I can’t recommend Kiwi Cru’s wine tastings enough. It was a brilliant way for our team to connect, switch off from work, and share something completely different together.” </h4><p>Georgia, Hera Clothing</p>",
            "author": "",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_zyWxGq": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4><em><strong>Pippa was such a wonderful host, she was very knowledgeable about all the wines and made it a fun learning experience about what we were tasting. But most importantly the wine selections were delicious! NZ wine is so underrated, I would recommend to anyone to try them. </strong></em></h4><p>Kendal O'Regan, Karma Drinks</p>",
            "author": "",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_QYykFq": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4><em><strong>Fantastic Kiwi wine, a wonderfully relaxed evening with plenty of learning! Pippa's energy, expertise, and fun personality made it a great event that I would recommend.</strong></em></h4><p>Jon Briggs, Karma Drinks </p>",
            "author": "",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_jnixea": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>\"Pippa was a great host for our team wine tasting. She shared a selection of delicious NZ wines, intertwined with fun facts and even a pop-quiz at the end. The team loved it, and it really was a fab way to spend a team social!”</h4><p>Gabs, Karma Drinks</p>",
            "author": "",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
